久以往，恐怕交房租真有压力了。他平时一天算上两块钱一包的卷烟，只吃二十块钱以内的东西，用的也是极为节省，可毕竟还得交水电费，还得有别的林林总总的支出。帮柳宏斌代班开车，或者去工地做点苦力活，都不是什么稳定的工作。事实上，若不是一年前在早餐店里偶遇到柳宏斌，认识了以后还算谈得来，又发现住得很近，他都没机会跟他认识，并且赚点出租车的外快。“得加紧找份差事，不然又得麻烦大伯去”，林飞头疼地挠挠后脑勺。作为临安本地人，林飞在临安还是有大伯这么一户亲戚的。正在这时，手机又响了起来。林飞接起一看，嘴角浮现一抹温和的笑意，说曹*，曹*就到。“喂，瑶瑶，怎么了？”打电话的是林飞的堂妹，林瑶，是大伯林大元三十多岁晚来得到的宝贝闺女。不过林大元和林瑶父女俩住在临安郊区的水口村。林飞一年多前回到家乡，小时候住的商品房早被拆掉了，找到大伯后，林大元就想让林飞跟他们一起住。但林飞知道，大伯母因为白血病去世得早，大伯一个人当爹又当妈，白天当环卫工人，晚上在路边摆摊修自行车，供着林瑶读大学就很辛苦。自己一个大男人不能再叫他费心，才执意来老城区租房子找工作。可大伯从小就特别疼他，就算住开了，也总让林瑶打电话来，问寒问暖，叫他去吃饭。在物欲横流的都市里，林飞从大伯和堂妹那儿，能体会到丝丝的家人亲情，自然格外珍视。电话那边传来一个清新甜美的女声，微微有点羞怯的意味。“哥，我爸要跟你说几句”，林瑶说完，立刻把电话给了父亲。林大元比林飞的父亲要长好几岁，嗓子格外苍老，“小飞，这个月房租够吗？要不大伯先给你送点去？别为了房租饭都不吃饱，这几百块大伯还是负担得起的。”林飞一阵汗颜，大伯都知道自己经济有点捉襟见肘，可那是大伯的血汗钱，哪能要，赶紧笑着宽慰：“大伯别担心，我最近帮老柳代班开出租赚了不少，没问题。”“哦，那就好，要多谢谢宏斌。对了，瑶瑶今晚回学校的时候，我让她顺便给你带些粽子去，快端午了”，林大元笑呵呵道。林飞笑着答应，又闲聊了几句，才挂了电话。心里计较着，看来不努力想办法赚钱是不行了，就算问老柳借钱也不能问大伯要啊。正掏出钥匙开门，林飞却是皱了下眉头，眼里瞬间闪烁出一道锐利的寒芒。将门打开，他走进自己只有三十多平米的小公寓，扫了一眼，一张钢丝床，一张小圆桌，一只板凳，全是二手货。一切都和自己离开前一样，但是，也就看起来一样而已。林飞的眼中渐渐散发出阵阵阴寒煞气，心中腾起了许久不曾有过的怒火。“叮铃铃……”手机这时再度响了起来。林飞看了眼，那上面的号码是一串乱七八糟的符号，根本不是数字。但林飞却认得，会打来这种电话的，全世界只有一个人……“一年多没联络了，你过的好吗，EVA”，林飞声音低沉地接起电话，脸色缓和下来，露出一抹淡淡的温柔与思念。电话那头，过了好一会儿，才传来一个外国女子磁性而妩媚的嗓音，一口标准的英式英语。“我……我很好，主人……您……您过得好吗？”“都回来这么久了，差不多习惯了，做个普通百姓，平平淡淡，粗茶淡饭地过日子，很不一样，却也很充实的人生”。林飞呵呵笑着，用一口地道伦敦腔英文笑着回应道：“我知道你为什么打电话给我，已经有人发现我在夏国了……这也没办法，世界太小了，早晚会被找到的。”EVA现在那边一惊，“什么？主人，是有人胆敢对您动手了么？对不起……是EVA失职了，请主人责罚！”女人很惶恐和担忧，语气中满满是内疚和惭愧。“不用这么紧张，他们还没愚蠢到对我直接下手，应该只是想找那点东西”。林飞宽慰道。“没错，是EVA多虑了，量维克多他就算知道主人您的身体状况，也不敢轻易冒犯主人您的威严！”EVA很是自豪与爱慕地道。林飞眼里陡然闪烁一道异色，“哦？是维克多？他来夏国了？”EVA那儿好奇地道：“主人，您遇到的不是维克多的人吗？”“我的住所被潜行高手极为隐蔽搜查过了，如果是维克多，应该不会派他的手下，做这么无聊的事。他跟随我多年，知道这种伎俩瞒得过别人，但不可能瞒过我林飞，这么说来，应该有最少两批人，知道了我的下落”，林飞思忖着道。EVA突然语气一变，冷厉地道：“主人，说不定就是维克多利用了您的这种思维方式，反其道行之，或者是他抖露了您的隐居地。您一定要小心维克多，他这一年来为了找到您费尽心思，甚至不惜来找我来套您的消息，我都拒绝见他了。虽然他明面上对内部一直说，只是太过想念您，要找到您叙旧，但我认为，他的目标肯定是‘钥匙’。”“随便他吧……只要不是太过分，我也无所谓，毕竟他是目前来看最合适的接班人……”林飞轻笑道。EVA幽幽一叹，“主人，您当初为什么要选择回到夏国呢，虽然那是您的家乡，但夏国政府太敏感了，又高手众多，您就算要归隐，也不太合适吧……”“你早就想问这个问题了吧”，林飞莞尔一笑，他直到这女人是怕他不悦，一直忍着疑问呢。EVA“嗯”了声，被猜中了小心思，她的确只敢在电话里这么询问林飞的决定原因。“我在等一个人……这个人要我在夏国等他，就算没那件事，我今年其实也打算回家乡了，这次只是提早罢了”，林飞道。“哦……”EVA也不问是什么人，犹豫了下，柔柔道：“主人，EVA好想你……好想去找你……”“当初你答应过我，不会来找我，我才把联络方式留给了你一个人，允许你向我汇报一些紧急情况，你不要辜负我的信任”，林飞正色道。“可是……主人您已经被他们找到了”，EVA几分幽怨地嘀咕……“小爱娃，你不听话了？”林飞似笑非笑地淡淡问道。EVA在电话那头因为畏惧而一个激灵，沉默了好一会儿，才应道：“我知道了……EVA听话……”林飞心里不忍，却也没办法，这个女人绝对不能让她到临安，甚至都不能到夏国。不然夏国各界的大佬们，甚至首长们，绝对会关注过来，追究为什么她愿意来到夏国。届时，有心的人肯定能找到自己身上。于是说了几句暖心话，让她乖乖在国外待着，才挂了电话。看了看自己的小租房，林飞摇摇头，自言自语道：“钥匙……钥匙，说了没有，果然没人信啊……”林飞仿佛嘲讽着什么，自言自语地笑了笑，便自己的衣服裤子一脱，走进卫生间冲澡。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/nuzongcaideshenjibaobiao/8.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 0008 EVA came out of Beixiu Villa and drove all the way back to Lao Liu's house, but Lin Fei's thoughts were still stuck on Su Yingxue. He really hoped that the woman would contact him, not because he wanted to know if she really wanted to call the police to arrest him, but because looking at the woman's appearance, he was inevitably a little touched in his heart and wanted to see her more. Even though I knew that he was not the person in my memory, and that his stubbornness could be described as terrible, I still couldn't let him go. Shaking his head and putting aside some stupid thoughts, Lin Fei increased the accelerator. Liu Hongbin's family lives in the old town west of Lin'an City. It is a small two-story house with a single family, and the streets are full of old residents. Lin Fei saw that Liu Hongbin and his wife Yu Meimei might have gone shopping for groceries, so he parked the car in front of their house and walked to the small cheap apartment he rented. The small apartment was built in the late 1980s and was in disrepair. Only poor people like Lin Fei, single men and women, would rent it and make do with it. Lin Fei ran upstairs and saw a notice on the door urging him to pay the rent. Although he was rich for the time being, in the long run, he might be really stressed about paying the rent. He usually costs two yuan a pack of cigarettes a day and only eats things that cost less than twenty yuan a day. He also spends money very sparingly, but after all, he still has to pay utility bills and various other expenses. Helping Liu Hongbin drive or go to the construction site to do some hard work are not stable jobs. In fact, if he hadn't met Liu Hongbin by chance in a breakfast shop a year ago, and they got along well with each other after getting to know him, and then found out that he lived very close to him, he would not have had the chance to get to know him and earn some extra money as a taxi. \"I have to find a job quickly, otherwise I will have to trouble my uncle again.\" Lin Fei scratched the back of his head with a headache. As a native of Lin'an, Lin Fei still had a relative like his uncle in Lin'an. At this moment, the phone rang again. Lin Fei picked it up and took a look, a gentle smile appeared on the corner of his mouth, and said Cao*, Cao* will be here. \"Hey, Yaoyao, what's wrong?\" The caller was Lin Fei's cousin, Lin Yao, the precious daughter whom the eldest brother, Lin Dayuan, got late when he was in his thirties. However, father and daughter Lin Dayuan and Lin Yao live in Shuikou Village on the outskirts of Lin'an. Lin Fei returned to his hometown more than a year ago. The commercial house he lived in when he was a child had long been demolished. After finding his uncle, Lin Dayuan wanted Lin Fei to live with them. But Lin Fei knew that his eldest aunt died early due to leukemia. His eldest uncle was a father and a mother by himself. He worked as a sanitation worker during the day and set up a roadside stall to repair bicycles at night. It was very hard for Lin Yao to study in college. As a grown man, I couldn't ask him to bother anymore, so I decided to rent a house in the old city and find a job. But his uncle had been very fond of him since he was a child. Even if he moved away, he would always ask Lin Yao to call him, ask him for help, and ask him to go to dinner. In a city where materialism prevails, Lin Fei can experience the slightest family affection from his uncle and cousin, so he naturally cherishes it. A fresh and sweet female voice came from the other side of the phone, slightly shy. \"Brother, my dad wants to tell you a few words.\" After Lin Yao finished speaking, she immediately gave the phone to her father. Lin Dayuan was several years older than Lin Fei's father, and his voice was particularly old. \"Xiao Fei, is the rent enough for this month? How about I send you some first? Don't have to eat for the rent. I can still afford these hundreds of yuan.\" Lin Fei felt ashamed. The uncle knew that his finances were a little stretched, but that was the uncle. How can I ask for my hard-earned money? I quickly smiled and reassured: \"Uncle, don't worry, I have made a lot of money recently by driving a rental car for Lao Liu, no problem.\" \"Oh, that's good. Thank you Hong Bin. By the way, when Yaoyao returns to school tonight, I asked her to bring you some rice dumplings. It's almost the Dragon Boat Festival,\" Lin Dayuan said with a smile. Lin Fei agreed with a smile, chatted for a few more words, and then hung up the phone. I was thinking about it, and it seemed that I couldn't make money if I didn't work hard. Even if I asked Lao Liu to borrow money, I couldn't ask my uncle for it. Just as he took out the key to open the door, Lin Fei frowned, and a sharp cold light flashed in his eyes. Opening the door, he walked into his small apartment of just over thirty square meters. He glanced at it and saw a wire bed, a small round table, and a bench, all second-hand goods. Everything is the same as before he left, but it just looks the same. Lin Fei's eyes gradually exuded waves of cold evil energy, and there was an anger in his heart that he had not felt for a long time. \"Ding ding ding...\" The phone rang again. Lin Fei took a look and saw that the number on it was a bunch of random symbols, not numbers at all. But Lin Fei recognized that there was only one person in the world who would make such a call... \"I haven't contacted you in more than a year. How are you, EVA?\" Lin Fei answered the phone in a low voice, his face softened, revealing a touch of tenderness and longing. On the other end of the phone, after a while, the magnetic and charming voice of a foreign woman came through, speaking standard British English. \"I...I'm fine. Master...you...how are you doing?\" \"I've been back for so long, and I'm almost used to it. Being an ordinary person, living an ordinary life with simple meals, is a very different, but also very fulfilling life.\" Lin Fei chuckled and responded with an authentic London accent: \"I know why you called me. Someone has already discovered that I am in Xia Country... There is nothing we can do about it. The world is too small, and I will be found sooner or later.\" EVA was shocked now, \"What? Master, did someone dare to attack you? I'm sorry... EVA has neglected his duty, please punish me!\" The woman was very frightened and worried, and her tone was full of guilt and shame. \"Don't be so nervous. They are not stupid enough to attack me directly. They probably just want to find that thing.\" Lin Fei said with relief. \"That's right, EVA is overly worried. Even if Victor knows your physical condition, he would not dare to offend your majesty!\" EVA said with great pride and admiration.", "title_en": "Chapter 8"}